00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,722
What if software drew its own interface?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,768
CEMIVO reads the whole screen, together with where you click.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,304
DeepSeek interprets your intent. An agent handles the task.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,348
Then the drawing models update the screen. A local change, or a new view.

5
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,336
One screen. Shaped by AI. Built around your intent.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,264
CEMIVO. An open source research prototype.

